  "steps": [
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "ひだまりストア、閉店後。",
      "bg": "images/assets/bg/bg_hidamari_store_salesfloor_night.png",
      "bgMode": "forceReplace",
      "forceBackgroundReplace": true,
      "clearStorySprites": true
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "春の新生活フェア初日が終わり、店内には少しだけ落ち着いた空気が流れていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "日中は洗濯機売場もかなり賑わった。\n新生活用の洗濯機を探すお客様。\n子どもの部活動に備えて買い替えを考える家族。\n節水性能を気にする夫婦。\n春から一人暮らしを始める学生。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "その一人ひとりに、彩愛さんは丁寧に向き合っていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "俺は売上報告の簡単な確認を終えて、洗濯機売場へ向かう。\nそこでは、彩愛さんがフェア用POPを一枚ずつ外しながら、売場を整えていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "彩愛さん、お疲れさまです"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "店長こそ、お疲れさまでした",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "今日、洗濯機売場かなり好評でしたね"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ええ。ありがたいことですわ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛さんは、穏やかに微笑んだ。\nその表情はいつも通り上品で落ち着いている。\nけれど、一日中接客を続けていたからか、ほんの少しだけ疲れも見えた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "片付け、手伝います"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ありがとうございます。では、こちらのPOPをまとめていただけますか？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "POPには、緋奈が描いた桜のイラストと、小さなふきのとうの絵が添えられている。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "『春の新生活と外遊びの汚れ対策』\n『毎日の洗濯だから、水も洗剤も賢く節約』\n『泥汚れも、夜の洗濯も、暮らしに合わせて選びましょう』"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "このPOP、かなりお客様の反応良かったですね"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "緋奈さんのイラストが明るくて、目を引きましたもの",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "それもありますけど、内容も良かったです"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "内容、ですか？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい。春の汚れとか、節水とか、毎日の使いやすさとか"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "洗濯機を選ぶ時には、どれも大切なことですわ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "彩愛さんらしい売場になってました"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "わたくしらしい、ですか",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "それは、褒め言葉として受け取ってよろしいのでしょうか？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "もちろんです"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "そこへ、売場の奥から緋奈が顔を出した。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "あ、店長！　彩愛さん！　片付け手伝います！",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "緋奈、レジ締めの方は終わったのか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "はい！　もっちーさんに確認してもらいました！",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "では、こちらの装飾をお願いしてもよろしいですか？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "任せてください！",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "緋奈は元気よく桜の飾りを外し始めた。\nそして、ふきのとうのイラスト入りPOPを見つける。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "あ、このふきのとうPOP、けっこう好評でしたよね！",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そうだな。意外と足を止めるお客様が多かった"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "お客様に『これ可愛いですね』って言われました！",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "緋奈さんの絵が可愛らしかったからですわ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "えへへ。でも、ふきのとう案は彩愛さんですよね！",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "案というほどのものではありませんわ。春といえば、ふと思い浮かんだだけです",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "それがいいんですよ！　彩愛さんって、春の出し方も上品ですよね！",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "上品……でしょうか",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ふきのとうの天ぷらの話もしてましたけど"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "緋奈",
      "text": "えっ、天ぷら！　また食べたくなってきた！",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "緋奈さんは、本当に食べ物のお話に素直ですわね",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "緋奈が別の作業に呼ばれて去る。\n売場には、店長と彩愛の二人が残った。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "今日のフェア、本当に彩愛さんのおかげです"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "まあ。また褒めてくださるのですか？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "店長は、人を甘やかすのがお上手ですわね",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "甘やかしてるつもりはないです"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "では？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ちゃんと見たことを言っているだけです"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛さんの手が、少し止まった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……そういうところですわ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "え？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "いえ。続けてくださいませ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "あ、はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "俺は、今日の売場を思い返した。\n洗濯機の容量を気にするお客様。\n節水性能を気にするお客様。\n夜に洗濯するから音が心配だというお客様。\n子どもの泥汚れに困っているお客様。\n春から一人暮らしを始めるお客様。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛さんは、その全員に違う説明をしていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "彩愛さんの接客って、ただ上品なだけじゃないんですよね"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……と、申しますと？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "暮らしを知っている感じがします"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "暮らしを……",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "水道代とか、洗剤代とか、泥汚れとか、春のふきのとうとか"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "最後のものは、洗濯機から少し離れている気もいたしますが",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "でも、今日の売場にはちゃんとつながってました"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "彩愛さんの言葉って、カタログを読んでいるだけじゃ出てこないと思うんです"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "そうでしょうか",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい。ちゃんと生活の中で考えている人の言葉です"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛さんは、何かを言おうとして、少しだけ口を閉じた。\nそれから、困ったように笑う。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "それは……少し、庶民的すぎませんこと？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "どうしてですか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "水道代や洗剤代を気にしたり、泥汚れの話をしたり、ふきのとうの天ぷらを思い出したり",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……あまり、上品な話ばかりではありませんわ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そこがいいんです"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……そこが、ですか？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛さんが、不意を突かれたようにこちらを見る。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "彩愛さんは上品です。でも、それだけじゃなくて、ちゃんと暮らしを知っているから、お客様に届くんだと思います"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "水道代を気にするのも、泥汚れに詳しいのも、春のふきのとうを覚えているのも、全部彩愛さんの強みだと思います"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "強み……",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛さんは、しばらく黙っていた。\n売場の照明が、閉店後の静かな店内を照らしている。\n洗濯機の白いボディに、春フェアの桜色が少し映っていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "店長は、本当に不思議な方ですわね",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "また不思議ですか"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ええ。わたくしが少し隠したいと思うところを、まるで良いもののようにおっしゃいますもの",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "良いものだと思いますよ"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "少なくとも、俺はそう思います"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛さんは、小さく息を吐いた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "そうですか",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "では、少しだけ……自信を持ってみることにいたしますわ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ぜひ"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ただし",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "ただし？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "あまり褒めすぎてはいけません",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "どうしてですか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "調子が狂いますもの",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "彩愛さんでも？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ええ。わたくしでも、です",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "そう言って、彩愛さんは少しだけ笑った。\nいつもの完璧な微笑みより、ほんの少しだけ柔らかい。\n飾りすぎていない笑顔だった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "やがてPOPがすべて外され、売場は通常の落ち着いた姿に戻っていった。\nしかし、フェアの名残りのように、小さなふきのとうのイラストが一枚だけ残っていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "あれ、これだけ残ってますね"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "まあ。本当ですわね",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "記念に取っておきます？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ふきのとうのPOPを、ですか？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "今日の売場の功労者なので"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ふふ。店長は、物に意味を持たせるのがお上手ですわね",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "捨てます？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……いえ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "せっかくですから、控えとして残しておきましょう",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "また春の売場で使えるかもしれませんし",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そうですね"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "それに……",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "それに？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "少しだけ、懐かしい気持ちになれましたから",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "そう言う彩愛さんの声は、とても静かだった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "彩愛さんの実家って、自然が多いんですね"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ええ。田舎ですから",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "やっぱり、育ちが良さそうですよね"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "まあ。そんなことはありませんわ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そうですか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ええ。わたくしなど、普通の家で育っただけですもの",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛さんは、何気なくそう言った。\nその言い方には、迷いも見栄もなかった。\n本当に、ただ普通のことを話しているようだった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "普通の家、ですか"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "はい。少し自然が多くて、季節のものが身近だっただけですわ",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "それ、いいですね"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……店長は、本当に何でも褒めますのね",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "何でもじゃないですよ"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "では、何を褒めていらっしゃるのです？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "彩愛さんが大切にしているもの、ですかね"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……大切にしているもの",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい。暮らしとか、季節とか、お客様の毎日とか"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛さんは、ふきのとうのPOPをそっと重ねた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "大切にしているつもりは、あります",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "はい"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "けれど、それを誰かに見つけていただけるとは、あまり思っておりませんでした",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "そうなんですか？"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "ええ。こういうものは、あまり目立つものではありませんから",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "でも、ちゃんと見ている人はいます"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……店長のことですか？",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "店長",
      "text": "少なくとも、俺は見ています"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "……",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "彩愛",
      "text": "本当に、油断なりませんわね",
      "storySprites": [
        {
          "id": "aa",
          "src": "images/assets/char/a10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "ak",
          "src": "images/assets/char/k10101.webp",
          "opacity": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "洗濯機売場のフェアは無事に終わった。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "今日、店長は彩愛の接客がただ上品なだけではないことを改めて知る。\n水道代、洗剤代、泥汚れ、春のふきのとう。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "そのどれもが、彩愛の中では暮らしにつながっていた。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "彩愛は、自分の生活感や素朴な話を少し恥ずかしがっている。\nけれど店長は、そこにこそ彩愛の魅力があると感じる。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "そして彩愛は何気なく言う。"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "「わたくしなど、普通の家で育っただけですもの」"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "その“普通”が、後に少しだけ違う意味を持つことを、今の店長はまだ知らない。"
    }
  ]
}
